  <Docs>
    <summary>Builds a conversation status from an identifier, an activity, and optional status details.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The identifier and activity are supplied to the constructor. Availability initially is unknown, the description and image initially are <see langword="null" />, and both times initially are <c>-1</c>. Each setter returns this builder.</para>
      <para>Call <see cref="M:Android.App.People.ConversationStatus.Builder.Build" /> to create a status from the current settings. This does not publish the status.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/1a5cb387d6542391d0edf69cdd828e5b7c8a9d65/core/java/android/app/people/ConversationStatus.java">Android builder implementation</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
